{"unit_id":"MuziIsabel__dsh-win-notify#card-zh","repo":"MuziIsabel/dsh-win-notify","commit":"8f2ec74406b4cd5f59b7d98f2ed949641326ce3c","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-win-notify 是面向 Windows 的 DSH 插件，可在顶层代理任务结束、出错或等待审批与用户回复时发出带声音的系统 Toast，并在通知正文显示最近的用户提示。它通过宿主事件监听和 Windows PowerShell 5.1 创建通知，支持点击通知切回相关 GUI 会话、抑制当前正在查看会话的提醒，并允许配置声音、等待时间和提示文本。适合希望在后台运行 DSH 时及时获知任务状态的 Windows 用户；需要 Windows PowerShell 和 DSH，默认不需要额外账号或 API 密钥。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:839-923","index.js:673-697","cordis.patch.yml:21-26"]}
{"unit_id":"MuziIsabel__dsh-win-notify#card-en","repo":"MuziIsabel/dsh-win-notify","commit":"8f2ec74406b4cd5f59b7d98f2ed949641326ce3c","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-win-notify is a Windows plugin for DSH that shows sound-enabled toasts on task completion, errors, pending approvals, or user questions. Toasts may include the latest prompt and open the related GUI session. It uses PowerShell 5.1; no API key or account is configured.","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:839-923","index.js:673-697","cordis.patch.yml:21-26"]}
